          "author": "Valerie Tripp",
          "seriestitle": "American Girl: WellieWishers Storytime",
          "description": "The WellieWishers are raising chickens! The girls are thrilled when their hen, Queen Ruby, begins laying eggs. But when the first egg hatches, Queen Ruby doesn't seem to know what to do, so Emerson takes charge. Soon, the tiny chick, Princess Peep, is following her everywhere. Caring for a chick is a bigger job than Emerson expected! ",
